---
// AIDLC Suite — product cards adapted to site beige theme
---

<div class="aidlc-grid">

  <!-- VS Code Extension -->
  <div class="ac-card">
    <div class="ac-head">
      <h3>AIDLC for VS Code</h3>
      <span class="ac-kind">VS Code Extension</span>
    </div>
    <p class="ac-desc">The Builder UI for your AI pipelines. Edit <code>workspace.yaml</code> visually, follow active runs in the sidebar, and open the AIDLC Monitor for token usage and live agent observability.</p>
    <ul class="ac-features">
      <li>Visual Builder for <code>.aidlc/workspace.yaml</code></li>
      <li>Sidebar with live run states &amp; commands</li>
      <li>AIDLC Monitor — tokens, sessions, agents</li>
      <li>Session-insights dashboard from Claude transcripts</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="ac-actions">
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-primary" href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=hueanmy.aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Install from VS Code Marketplace
      </a>
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-ghost" href="https://open-vsx.org/extension/hueanmy/aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Install from Open VSX</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CLI -->
  <div class="ac-card">
    <div class="ac-head">
      <h3>AIDLC CLI</h3>
      <span class="ac-kind">Terminal · npm</span>
    </div>
    <p class="ac-desc">The standalone engine — no VS Code required. Scaffold workspaces, apply pipeline presets, drive runs end-to-end via Claude, and watch everything live from your shell.</p>
    <ul class="ac-features">
      <li><code>aidlc init</code> + presets: sdlc, code-review, release-notes</li>
      <li><code>aidlc run exec --auto-approve</code> — unattended runs</li>
      <li><code>aidlc watch</code> / <code>tail</code> — live run table &amp; stream</li>
      <li><code>aidlc dashboard</code> — browser UI on localhost</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="ac-actions">
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-primary" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc/tree/main/packages/cli" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        npm install -g aidlc
      </a>
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-ghost" href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on npm</a>
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source on GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AIDLC Term -->
  <div class="ac-card">
    <div class="ac-head">
      <h3>AIDLC Term</h3>
      <span class="ac-kind">macOS · Windows (beta) · Rust + wgpu</span>
    </div>
    <p class="ac-desc">A GPU-accelerated terminal built for agent work: file explorer that follows your shell, agent manager for every Claude Code session, and a live token-usage dashboard.</p>
    <ul class="ac-features">
      <li>GPU rendering (wgpu) — tabs, splits, IME-perfect input</li>
      <li>Agent Manager — status, live tails, focus / interrupt</li>
      <li>Usage Dashboard — burn rate &amp; limit prediction</li>
      <li>File tree follows the shell's cwd</li>
      <li>Native shortcuts — ⌘ on macOS, Ctrl+Shift on Windows</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="ac-actions">
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-primary" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc-io.github.io/releases/download/term-v0.3.2/AIDLC-Term-0.3.2.dmg">
        Download for macOS <span class="ac-sub">v0.3.2 · 5.5 MB</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc-io.github.io/releases/download/term-v0.3.2/AIDLC-Term-0.3.2-windows.zip">
        Download for Windows <span class="ac-sub">v0.3.2 · 5.3 MB</span>
      </a>
      <p class="ac-note">macOS: not notarized — first launch via System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Open Anyway. Windows is in beta.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AIDLC TestAgent -->
  <div class="ac-card">
    <div class="ac-head">
      <h3>AIDLC TestAgent</h3>
      <span class="ac-kind">CLI · npm · TypeScript</span>
    </div>
    <p class="ac-desc">Open-source AI test agent for web, desktop, API &amp; mobile. Point it at a target, approve the plan, get a passing test suite. No telemetry, no model API keys required.</p>
    <ul class="ac-features">
      <li>Supports web, desktop, API &amp; mobile targets</li>
      <li>Approve the generated test plan before execution</li>
      <li>No telemetry, no external model API keys</li>
      <li>Outputs a runnable test suite you own</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="ac-actions">
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-primary" href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/aidlc-testagent" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        npm install -g aidlc-testagent
      </a>
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc-testagent" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source on GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<style>
  .aidlc-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .aidlc-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .aidlc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .ac-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: box-shadow 150ms ease, transform 150ms ease;
  }
  .ac-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .ac-head {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .ac-head h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin: 0 0 0.2rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .ac-kind {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .ac-desc {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .ac-desc code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82em;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.05em 0.3em;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
  }

  .ac-features {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .ac-features li {
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    padding: 0.22rem 0 0.22rem 1.1rem;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .ac-features li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0.1rem;
    top: 0.6rem;
    width: 5px; height: 5px;
    border-radius: 1.5px;
    background: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.55;
  }
  .ac-features code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.05em 0.3em;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
  }

  .ac-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }
  .ac-btn {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 120ms, border-color 120ms;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .ac-btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
  .ac-btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); }
  .ac-btn-ghost {
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .ac-btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--fg-muted); color: var(--fg); }

  .ac-sub { font-weight: 400; opacity: 0.75; font-size: 0.66rem; }
  .ac-note { font-size: 0.63rem; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; text-align: center; }
</style>
